WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:20.171
Hi there! Who are you?

2
00:00:20.172 --> 00:00:23.522
I'm a cheetah.

3
00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:26.882
Cheetahs are a type of large cat.

4
00:00:26.883 --> 00:00:31.871
We're the fastest land animal on earth!

5
00:00:31.872 --> 00:00:34.912
Where do you live?

6
00:00:34.913 --> 00:00:37.792
We live in Africa.

7
00:00:37.793 --> 00:00:45.931
We live in open grasslands called savannas.

8
00:00:45.932 --> 00:00:50.031
You have lots of cool spots.

9
00:00:50.032 --> 00:00:53.826
Cheetahs are covered with black dots.

10
00:00:53.827 --> 00:01:00.332
They help us hide in the grass.

11
00:01:00.333 --> 00:01:03.362
What do you eat?

12
00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:09.022
Cheetahs mostly eat small animals like hares.

13
00:01:09.023 --> 00:01:14.489
But we also eat big animals like antelopes!

14
00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:18.693
How do cheetahs run so fast?

15
00:01:18.694 --> 00:01:22.946
Our legs are very powerful.

16
00:01:22.947 --> 00:01:29.021
We're also thin, with small heads.

17
00:01:29.022 --> 00:01:33.985
Cheetahs probably always catch their prey.

18
00:01:33.986 --> 00:01:35.758
Nope!

19
00:01:35.759 --> 00:01:39.591
Cheetahs can only run for about a minute.

20
00:01:39.592 --> 00:01:51.652
Then we need to rest.

21
00:01:51.653 --> 00:01:54.752
How do you hunt then?

22
00:01:54.753 --> 00:01:59.372
Cheetahs can see very far.

23
00:01:59.373 --> 00:02:05.192
We spot our prey and sneak closer . . .

24
00:02:05.193 --> 00:02:11.580
Once we're close enough, we run—fast!

25
00:02:11.581 --> 00:02:14.919
I see an antelope.

26
00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:18.820
Good-bye!

27
00:02:18.821 --> 00:02:26.173
Good-bye, Cheetah!
